  entryId: MiasmaForestNote
  title: Torn Diary Page
  bodyText: "We arrived on the island weeks ago. The ground pulses, the plants grow
    in impossible ways. Some men fell ill, others disappeared. The others called
    it \u2018Miasma\u2019. They say the island is alive, that it\u2019s watching
    us. I don\u2019t know how much longer we can last."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
